## Cursor-Specific Settings

- Prefer tab-based autocomplete
- Use @ references for context (e.g., `@AGENTS.md`)
- Use Composer for multi-file changes

---

## Quick Reference

| Need to... | Command |
|------------|---------|
| Implement feature | Use Cmd+K or Composer |
| Debug issue | Use Cursor chat with @ references |
| Sprint planning | Reference @AGENTS.md for workflow |
| Audit codebase | Reference @AGENTS.md for patterns |

